//! A ready-made service that pushes events to browsers over SSE (server-sent events).
//!
//! The API publishes an event on a channel of the key-value server (DragonflyDB, Valkey or Redis); this service hands it to
//! the browsers it is for, who hold a stream open. No business logic, no database. See `server` for how it is put
//! together and `registry` for why it holds tens of thousands of streams in a small, bounded amount of memory.
